{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/stripecardscan"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/stripecardscan"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This library provides a user interface through which users can scan payment cards and extract information from them. It uses the Stripe Publishable Key to authenticate with Stripe services.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Note that this is a standalone SDK and, while compatible with, does not directly integrate with the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/stripe.com\/docs\/api\/payment_intents","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" API nor with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/stripe.com\/docs\/api\/errors#errors-payment_intent-next_action","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This library can be used entirely outside of a Stripe integration and with other payment processing providers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Requirements","anchor":"Requirements","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS 15.0 or higher"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode 15 or higher"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/stripe\/stripe-ios\/tree\/master\/Example\/CardImageVerification%20Example","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" directory for an example application that you can try for yourself!"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Installation","anchor":"Installation","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":